Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:32.86,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}勇士与懦夫的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:34.49,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}奏响破绽的序曲(Overture)
