Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:09.02,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}弱小的棋子啊 舞动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:10.82,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Du-Ra-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.82,0:04:14.61,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}在我的掌心上
